{"candidateAnswer":"A couple of different combat sports","evidence":"[D2:28 | 6:10 pm on 22 December, 2022] John:  Yep, let's keep making great memories with our loved ones and cherishing the time we have. I'm off to do some taekwondo!\n[D1:4 | 11:01 am on 17 December, 2022] John: Woah, Maria, that sounds cool! I'm doing kickboxing and it's giving me so much energy.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7f44ddbc-4ac0-5052-9ac9-53ec4a0b2a56","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:21666f30fdc4941e015b57814095336d164466b9a2b60cf2a9fcc853c1c1d5cc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What martial arts has John done?","referenceAnswer":"Kickboxing, Taekwondo","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"21666f30fdc4941e015b57814095336d164466b9a2b60cf2a9fcc853c1c1d5cc"}}]}